<textList name="EVLBL_MANTIS_CIVILIAN">
	<text>[ Mantis ship attacking civilian ]

A Mantis vessel flashes past your view-screen, weapons and engines at full. A tiny blip on the sensor readout marks its quarry.</text>
	<text>[ Mantis ship attacking civilian ]

You spot a Mantis ship hunting in the distance.</text>
	<text>[ Mantis ship attacking civilian ]

A Mantis ship engaging a civilian hails you. Sparks fly about his cockpit as he yells, "Stay out of this human! Else you are next!"</text>
	<text>[ Mantis ship attacking civilian ]

Local sensors pick up two ships engaged in a heated battle. It seems the Mantis military ship will surely defeat its prey.</text>
	<text>[ Mantis ship attacking civilian ]

You pick up a distress call from a civilian ship. It's being chased by a Mantis ship!</text>
